{{!
    @template theme_saec/components/boleta_summary

    Student "Boleta Digital" summary row (/grade/report/user/index.php) —
    three real-data metric cards (overall course-total %, completed items,
    status) injected ABOVE the native gradereport_user table, not replacing
    it. Reuses the shared theme_saec/components/metric_card partial (same
    one used by Calificador/Asistencia/Rendimiento Académico) rather than
    inventing a new card component. Context from
    \theme_saec\dashboard\boleta_page::get_context().

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cards": [
            {
                "key": "overallgrade", "icon": "<img src=\"...\" alt=\"\">",
                "iconvariant": "primary", "label": "Calificación General",
                "value": "72.5", "hasvaluesuffix": true, "valuesuffix": "%",
                "hasfootnote": false, "footnote": null
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="saec-boleta-summary row">
    {{#cards}}
        <div class="col-12 col-md-4 mb-3">
            {{> theme_saec/components/metric_card }}
        </div>
    {{/cards}}
</div>
